<para id="RM0000030GN000X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="065BV-00" from="200612">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM0000030GN000X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM0000030GN000X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00009IB00000">
<ptxt>Accelerator Position Sensor Function Inspection</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Following the screen display, select [ECU Data Monitor] → [Accelerator Sensor No. 1 Voltage (VPA1) and Accelerator Sensor No. 2 Voltage (VPA2)], and check the values when the accelerator pedal is operated.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
<ptxt>[Abbreviation]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Accelerator Sensor No. 1 Voltage</ptxt>
<ptxt>[VPA1]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Accelerator pedal fully open</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>3.1 to 4.6 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Accelerator pedal fully closed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>0.4 to 1.4 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Accelerator Sensor No. 2 Voltage</ptxt>
<ptxt>[VPA2]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Accelerator pedal fully open</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>3.9 to 5.0 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Accelerator pedal fully closed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1.0 to 2.2 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
